{"1306060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Golf Club Architect", "steam_appid": 1306060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golf Club Architect is a game about creating, managing and playing your very own golf course. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start out with a few simple holes to get those green fees rolling in and as your funds accumulate further refine, grow and decorate your course to satisfy your customer's skill and aesthetic needs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/b04b359cf1c643a78b4ec92f9666b7bb.avif?t=1774985703\" width=600 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/ee5653ba91f5aad34eadf99cdf419b05.poster.avif?t=1774985703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/ee5653ba91f5aad34eadf99cdf419b05.webm?t=1774985703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/ee5653ba91f5aad34eadf99cdf419b05.mp4?t=1774985703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design and construct</strong> the golf course of your dreams from the ground up. Sculpt rolling terrain, carve out bunkers, shape fairways and greens with precision, then bring your vision to life with lush surfaces, water features, and carefully placed scenery. Every hole is yours to craft from challenging doglegs to sweeping par 5s. With an intuitive suite of terrain and object placement tools that make course design feel creative and rewarding. Whether you're recreating iconic layouts or dreaming up something entirely new, the possibilities are endless. Build a course that's uniquely yours, then watch as AI golfers take on every challenge you've designed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/31aa9ef14ef42d674052d708c60b8611.avif?t=1774985703\" width=600 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/25c4a52cfa1d0bd414b38db80faf561d.poster.avif?t=1774985703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/25c4a52cfa1d0bd414b38db80faf561d.webm?t=1774985703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/25c4a52cfa1d0bd414b38db80faf561d.mp4?t=1774985703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step onto the course</strong> you built and play it yourself. Take control of your own golfer and experience every hole firsthand, read the greens, judge the wind, select your club, and shape each shot with skill and precision. Challenge AI golfers head-to-head and prove you can conquer the very course you created. Feel the satisfaction of threading a drive down a tight fairway you designed, or sinking a clutch putt on a green you sculpted by hand. There's nothing quite like teeing off on a hole you created and discovering just how tough, or how rewarding, your design really is.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/5cb7be77c6c6c0ef0a9fb335595225f8.avif?t=1774985703\" width=600 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/29c322b6a100473bea938bc119566517.poster.avif?t=1774985703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/29c322b6a100473bea938bc119566517.webm?t=1774985703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/29c322b6a100473bea938bc119566517.mp4?t=1774985703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive deep into the data</strong> behind your course with a powerful suite of analysis tools. Study the beauty of your landscape through visual heatmaps and examine your terrain with detailed elevation overlays. Track how AI golfers tackle your holes  with shot analysis that reveals driving patterns, approach tendencies, and where players thrive or struggle. Every tool gives you the insight to refine, rebalance, and perfect your design, turning raw creativity into a course that plays as  brilliantly as it looks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/0828018549e4eaedceaa9d3bb0f430cf.avif?t=1774985703\" width=600 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/dbff304d96a585b016f71e2466fbed80.poster.avif?t=1774985703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/dbff304d96a585b016f71e2466fbed80.webm?t=1774985703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/dbff304d96a585b016f71e2466fbed80.mp4?t=1774985703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take charge of the business</strong> side of running a golf course. Keep a close eye on your finances, monitor income from green fees, track expenses, and make smart decisions to keep your course profitable. Hire and manage a team of groundskeepers to  maintain your fairways, tend your greens, and keep bunkers in pristine condition. A well-maintained course attracts more golfers and earns a stronger reputation, while neglecting upkeep will see standards slip and visitors dwindle. Balancing  the books with boots on the ground is the key to building a course that thrives. It takes more than great design to run a world-class golfing destination.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golf Club Architect is a game about creating, managing and playing your very own golf course. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start out with a few simple holes to get those green fees rolling in and as your funds accumulate further refine, grow and decorate your course to satisfy your customer's skill and aesthetic needs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/b04b359cf1c643a78b4ec92f9666b7bb.avif?t=1774985703\" width=600 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/ee5653ba91f5aad34eadf99cdf419b05.poster.avif?t=1774985703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/ee5653ba91f5aad34eadf99cdf419b05.webm?t=1774985703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/ee5653ba91f5aad34eadf99cdf419b05.mp4?t=1774985703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design and construct</strong> the golf course of your dreams from the ground up. Sculpt rolling terrain, carve out bunkers, shape fairways and greens with precision, then bring your vision to life with lush surfaces, water features, and carefully placed scenery. Every hole is yours to craft from challenging doglegs to sweeping par 5s. With an intuitive suite of terrain and object placement tools that make course design feel creative and rewarding. Whether you're recreating iconic layouts or dreaming up something entirely new, the possibilities are endless. Build a course that's uniquely yours, then watch as AI golfers take on every challenge you've designed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/31aa9ef14ef42d674052d708c60b8611.avif?t=1774985703\" width=600 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/25c4a52cfa1d0bd414b38db80faf561d.poster.avif?t=1774985703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/25c4a52cfa1d0bd414b38db80faf561d.webm?t=1774985703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/25c4a52cfa1d0bd414b38db80faf561d.mp4?t=1774985703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragr