r design, turning raw creativity into a course that plays as  brilliantly as it looks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/0828018549e4eaedceaa9d3bb0f430cf.avif?t=1774985703\" width=600 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/dbff304d96a585b016f71e2466fbed80.poster.avif?t=1774985703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/dbff304d96a585b016f71e2466fbed80.webm?t=1774985703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1306060/extras/dbff304d96a585b016f71e2466fbed80.mp4?t=1774985703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take charge of the business</strong> side of running a golf course. Keep a close eye on your finances, monitor income from green fees, track expenses, and make smart decisions to keep your course profitable. Hire and manage a team of groundskeepers to  maintain your fairways, tend your greens, and keep bunkers in pristine condition. A well-maintained course attracts more golfers and earns a stronger reputation, while neglecting upkeep will see standards slip and visitors dwindle. Balancing  the books with boots on the ground is the key to building a course that thrives. It takes more than great design to run a world-class golfing destination.</p>", "short_description": "Design, manage and play your very own golf course. Customise golfers, earn skill points and level up! Place surfaces props and edit terrain to craft the perfect golf course for the AI players.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio sup